title: Game Over
new-page: true
set-bg: img/3rd_October_2017.jpg
go-to: eg_menu
on-arrival: {!
    this.achieve('game_completed');

    if (Q.psoe_barons_revolted && !Q.psoe_sanchez_president_ever) {
      this.achieve('barones')
    }
    if (!Q.ni_un_paper_failed) {
      // TODO: Actual way for this to fail
      this.achieve("ni_un_paper");
    }

    // TODO: actual ending cards
!}

= End

@eg_menu

- #endings
- @end_game: End game.

@rubicon
title: The Rubicon was crossed
view-if: rubicon and not end_rubicon_seen
on-arrival: end_rubicon_seen = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

Your actions truly marked a before and after in Catalan politics. Time slows down...

@jxcat_formed
title: Formed jxcat
view-if: jxcat_formed and not end_jxcat_seen
on-arrival: end_jxcat_seen = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

The jxcat electoral coalition was formed as a continuation of a national-unity list! Congrats! (this path is still wip and will make more sense once rubicon is available)

@not_possible_parlament_stuck
title: Separated twins
subtitle: You managed something I did not think even possible
view-if: not_possible_parlament_stuck and not end_not_possible_parlament_stuck
on-arrival: end_not_possible_parlament_stuck = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

Truly, how did you manage to approve the Law on the Referendum but NOT the one on transition? Please drop a message on reddit, discord, or raise a GitHub issue. You deserve a medal nonetheless!

@end_temp
title: WIP ending cards
view-if: not end_temp_seen
on-arrival: end_temp_seen = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu
role: ending

Thanks for playing around! Ending cards are wip!

